# Keep the usage CSVs LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows git defaults to core.autocrlf=true and rewrites these
# files to CRLF on checkout. The scraper writes LF, so the file would flip line
# endings on every run — an endless diff — and reading it back would leave a
# trailing \r on the last column.
*.csv text eol=lf

# Same reasoning for the code: the hook path is written into settings.json and
# the scripts are copied verbatim into each person's config directory.
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
